 ent with the Grace Farms Education Team. Inspired by the exhibit With Ever
 y Fiber: Pigment\, Stone\, Glass\, families can explore the unique propert
 ies of building materials and use their imaginations to create new applica
 tions for them.\n\nSource: https://ctvisit.com/events/materials-studio
