DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260922
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261113
DTSTAMP:20261111T182120Z
UID:51e79904222a53548285fbb9dcba@ctvisit-calendar
DESCRIPTION:The Clinton Art Society (CAS) is pleased to present the Electe
 d Members Exhibition on view from September 22 through November 12\, 2026.
  The annual exhibit highlights work by more than 30 accomplished artists. 
 The opening reception is on Thursday\, September 24 from 4:30pm to 6:30pm 
 and is free and open to the public. “The exhibition is a celebration of 
 our Elected Members’ talents and individual artistic journeys. CAS is de
 lighted to showcase their art in this special show\,” said Robin-Hammeal
 -Urban\, CAS President.\n\nSource: https://ctvisit.com/events/elected-memb
 ers-exhibition
LOCATION:Andrews Memorial Town Hall\, 54 E. Main Street\, clinton CT\, 064
 13
URL:https://ctvisit.com/events/elected-members-exhibition
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
