BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Afterschool Adventures Session 2
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261027
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261223
DTSTAMP:20261111T182120Z
UID:5f3d8815e095567bf5bae542caa7@ctvisit-calendar
DESCRIPTION:The RTP Estuary Center’s afterschool program allows particip
 ants to engage in hands-on\, inquiry-based learning experiences through ST
 EAM-based activities. Participants will learn how to use various types of 
 scientific equipment and design and conduct experiments based on different
  weekly and seasonally themed topics\, while also incorporating crafts and
  games. Themes will reflect the seasonal change found in nature. Participa
 nts are encouraged to dress for the weather and bring a snack and a water 
 bottle. Open to Grade K-4.\n\nSource: https://ctvisit.com/events/afterscho
 ol-adventures-session-2
LOCATION:RTP Estuary Center\, 100 Lyme Street\, Old Lyme CT\, 06371
URL:https://ctvisit.com/events/afterschool-adventures-session-2
