 e Good District by Tony Meneses What do you deserve? A fractured family sq
 uats in a wealthy beachfront home to give 13-year-old Alisha a chance at a
  better life in an elite school. As Alisha’s academic success stirs susp
 icion among her teachers and peers\, the family’s precarious situation b
 egins to unravel. Learn More » Appropriate for ages 14 and up.\n\nSource:
  https://ctvisit.com/events/good-district
LOCATION:The Crystal Theatre\, 66 Bayview Avenue\, Norwalk CT\, 06850
