DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270208
DTSTAMP:20261111T182120Z
UID:070987e81acb3db5e00a20a06b38@ctvisit-calendar
DESCRIPTION:Exhibition open Wednesday through Sunday from 10am to 4pm with
  free parking and admission EXCEPT Thursday\, November 26 (Thanksgiving)\;
  Thursday\, December 24 (Christmas Eve)\, and Friday\, December 25 (Christ
 mas Day). The Nativity has been depicted by artists all over the world and
  is often open to interpretation as to who is included. The inclusion of a
 nimals is a common component of artworks depicting the Nativity\, ranging 
