 come one of the most highly sought after tribute bands in the world. Playi
 ng all over the globe for crowds upwards of 30\,000\, and with a track-rec
 ord of selling out shows everywhere they go\, this group is the real deal.
 \n\nSource: https://ctvisit.com/events/creedence-revived-0
